      "q": "How much does Department of Homeland Security spend on contracts?",
      "a": "The Department of Homeland Security obligated $1.2B in contracts in FY2027 to date. The Department awarded 2,410 contracts with an average award size of $493K. Obligations fell 98.4% year over year, and FY2027 totals are partial because the fiscal year is ongoing."
