    {
      "q": "What does Homeland Security buy?",
      "a": "The Department of Homeland Security buys a mix of services and construction in FY2027 to date. The top NAICS categories are All Other Travel Arrangement and Reservation Services at $279M, Commercial and Institutional Building Construction at $170M, and Security Guards and Patrol Services at $143M, among others."
